### Game loop — advancing the calendar.
### Requires the session from 00-auth.http.

### Where the world currently is: day, season, pending matches, inbox
# @name state
GET {{baseUrl}}/game/state

### Advance one day. The heavy one — this is the request to profile,
### to watch under `-Dspring-boot.run.profiles=sqldebug`, and to hang
### a conditional breakpoint off.
# @name advance
POST {{baseUrl}}/game/advance
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Jump straight to a calendar day
# @name advanceToDay
POST {{baseUrl}}/game/advanceToDay/45
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Fast-forward jobs — run many days in the background.

### Start a fast-forward job
# @name fastForwardStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/game/fast-forward
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "targetDay": 120
}

### Poll the running job
# @name fastForwardStatus
GET {{baseUrl}}/game/fast-forward

### Cancel it
# @name fastForwardCancel
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/game/fast-forward/1
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Save files. Export is available to any logged-in career; import is admin-only.

### Download the current world
# @name exportSave
GET {{baseUrl}}/game/export

### Squad and finances of the team you manage
# @name squad
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/allPlayers/{{teamId}}

### @name finances
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/finances/{{teamId}}

### @name availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/availability/{{teamId}}

### Inbox — the quickest confirmation that a day actually produced events
# @name inbox
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox/me
